@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:r a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:InverseFunctionalProperty . :A a owl:Class .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual , :A . :b a owl:NamedIndividual . :c a owl:NamedIndividual .
:a :r :c . :b :r :c .
[] a owl:AllDifferent ; owl:distinctMembers ( :a :b ) .
